    <title>
        ci: move models.dev automation to a scoped GitHub App (#11900)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-30T03:45:56Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63023139?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rekram1-node</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/rekram1-node</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;ci: move models.dev automation to a scoped GitHub App (#11900)

* ci: move models.dev automation to a scoped GitHub App

* ci: keep missing-model issues and pin publish checkout

* ci: allow sync symlinks that stay inside providers

* ci: pin Bun and freeze the lockfile in sync

* ci: recheck sync auto-merge limits in publish

* docs: describe sync token scope and auto-merge checks

* ci: block auto-merge when a sync deletes most of a provider&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
